GROMACS-PCFF Bridge
===================

This repository is a derived GROMACS fork for the bounded PCFF/Class2 bridge
described in README.md and docs/current_status_note.md.

It is not the official GROMACS distribution. For upstream GROMACS installation,
licensing, citation, and support information, see the upstream project at
https://www.gromacs.org and the files COPYING and CITATION.cff in this tree.

For this fork, start with README.md. It gives the current supported scope,
explicit non-claims, validation reports, and known limitations for the PCFF
bridge.
